---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Research | Jian Liu" description="Research interests of Jian Liu across AI for Science, scientific software, and computational biology." activePath="/research">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-kicker">RESEARCH / 01</p>
      <h1 data-en="Research interests" data-zh="研究方向">Research interests</h1>
      <p class="page-lead" data-en="My work connects biological questions with intelligent computational systems. I am particularly interested in reliable scientific agents, rigorous evaluation of scientific-software interaction, and computational approaches to cancer biology." data-zh="我的研究尝试将生物学问题与智能计算系统连接起来，重点关注可靠的科学智能体、科研软件交互的严谨评估，以及肿瘤生物学的计算研究。">My work connects biological questions with intelligent computational systems. I am particularly interested in reliable scientific agents, rigorous evaluation of scientific-software interaction, and computational approaches to cancer biology.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block page-content">
    <div class="container research-list">
      <article class="research-item" id="ai-for-science">
        <div class="research-index">01</div>
        <div class="research-body">
          <p class="section-kicker">AI FOR SCIENCE</p>
          <h2 data-en="Scientific agents and evidence-grounded research workflows" data-zh="科学智能体与基于证据的科研工作流">Scientific agents and evidence-grounded research workflows</h2>
          <p data-en="I explore how AI agents can translate scientific questions into executable workflows: identifying a disease state, interpreting mechanisms, selecting domain-specific tools, retrieving supporting evidence, and communicating uncertainty. An important design principle is to make each stage inspectable and to distinguish hypothesis generation from experimental validation." data-zh="我关注 AI 智能体如何将科学问题转化为可执行工作流，包括识别疾病状态、解释作用机制、选择领域工具、检索支持证据并表达不确定性。一个重要原则是让每个环节都可检查，并明确区分假设生成与实验验证。">I explore how AI agents can translate scientific questions into executable workflows: identifying a disease state, interpreting mechanisms, selecting domain-specific tools, retrieving supporting evidence, and communicating uncertainty. An important design principle is to make each stage inspectable and to distinguish hypothesis generation from experimental validation.</p>
          <div class="tag-row"><span>AI Agents</span><span>AI for Science</span><span>Evidence Retrieval</span><span>Reliability</span></div>
          <a class="arrow-link research-project-link" href="/projects#state2combo"><span data-en="Related project: State2Combo" data-zh="相关项目：State2Combo">Related project: State2Combo</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="research-item" id="scientific-software">
        <div class="research-index">02</div>
        <div class="research-body">
          <p class="section-kicker">SCIENTIFIC SOFTWARE & BENCHMARKING</p>
          <h2 data-en="When does GUI matter for scientific work?" data-zh="GUI 在科研工作中何时不可替代？">When does GUI matter for scientific work?</h2>
          <p data-en="I study the capabilities and limits of GUI-based interaction, MCP and other structured interfaces, and hybrid workflows in real scientific applications. The goal is to build task-grounded benchmarks that compare interfaces under matched evaluators and budgets, identify tasks that require visual or spatial interaction, and clarify where structured tools are more reliable." data-zh="我研究 GUI 交互、MCP 等结构化接口及混合工作流在真实科研软件中的能力与边界。目标是构建以实际任务为基础的基准，在统一评价器和资源预算下比较不同接口，识别需要视觉或空间交互的任务，并明确结构化工具在哪些场景下更加可靠。">I study the capabilities and limits of GUI-based interaction, MCP and other structured interfaces, and hybrid workflows in real scientific applications. The goal is to build task-grounded benchmarks that compare interfaces under matched evaluators and budgets, identify tasks that require visual or spatial interaction, and clarify where structured tools are more reliable.</p>
          <div class="tag-row"><span>GUI</span><span>MCP</span><span>Scientific Software</span><span>Benchmark Design</span><span>Reproducibility</span></div>
          <a class="arrow-link research-project-link" href="/projects#gui-benchmark"><span data-en="Related project: GUI vs. Structured Interfaces" data-zh="相关项目：GUI 与结构化接口基准研究">Related project: GUI vs. Structured Interfaces</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="research-item" id="computational-biology">
        <div class="research-index">03</div>
        <div class="research-body">
          <p class="section-kicker">COMPUTATIONAL BIOLOGY & DIGITAL PATHOLOGY</p>
          <h2 data-en="Computational oncology and morphology–molecular relationships" data-zh="计算肿瘤学与形态–分子关系">Computational oncology and morphology–molecular relationships</h2>
          <p data-en="My bioinformatics work uses transcriptomic cohorts, single-cell data, and experimental-model evidence to study tumor-associated programs. Current interests include stromal biology in colorectal cancer and whether tissue-level morphology captures, or fails to capture, underlying molecular states. I aim to connect computational observations with clearly defined biological questions and appropriately scoped validation." data-zh="我的生物信息学研究利用转录组队列、单细胞数据和实验模型证据分析肿瘤相关生物学程序。当前兴趣包括结直肠癌间质生物学，以及组织形态能否反映其背后的分子状态。我希望将计算观察与明确的生物学问题和适当范围的验证联系起来。">My bioinformatics work uses transcriptomic cohorts, single-cell data, and experimental-model evidence to study tumor-associated programs. Current interests include stromal biology in colorectal cancer and whether tissue-level morphology captures, or fails to capture, underlying molecular states. I aim to connect computational observations with clearly defined biological questions and appropriately scoped validation.</p>
          <div class="tag-row"><span>Bioinformatics</span><span>Computational Oncology</span><span>Single-cell Analysis</span><span>Digital Pathology</span><span>Colorectal Cancer</span></div>
          <a class="arrow-link research-project-link" href="/projects#morpho-molecular"><span data-en="Related project: Morpho-Molecular Decoupling" data-zh="相关项目：形态–分子解耦">Related project: Morpho-Molecular Decoupling</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-section">
    <div class="container closing-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">COLLABORATION</p>
      <h2 data-en="Good science is built together." data-zh="好的科学研究，来自开放合作。">Good science is built together.</h2>
      <p data-en="I welcome thoughtful discussions and collaborations across AI for Science, scientific software, and computational biology." data-zh="欢迎围绕科学人工智能、科研软件与计算生物学开展深入交流与合作。">I welcome thoughtful discussions and collaborations across AI for Science, scientific software, and computational biology.</p>
      <a class="button button-light" href="/contact"><span data-en="Get in touch" data-zh="联系交流">Get in touch</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
